
### 生成100条测试企业数据，编码从000001开始
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startCode": 1,
  "count": 100,
  "industry": "制造业",
  "regAuthority": "北京"
}
```

2.  触发数据采集：

```http request
### 采集单个企业数据
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/collect?code=000001

### 触发全量采集(不传code)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/collect
```

###3.  查询采集进度：

# taskId是上一步返回的实例ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/progress/{taskId}
```

###4.  查询采集结果：

# 分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/page?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&industry=制造业

### 单个查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/000092

### 增量查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/enterprise/increment?version=V20240326120000
```